Reason:
The fix adds checks to ensure that there are enough multicast and unicast filter entries available before running the tests. This prevents the tests from executing when the necessary resources are not available, thereby ensuring that the tests accurately reflect the expected behavior of the driver regarding multicast packet filtering.

